VeridianOS: ksystemstats: pass QMetaType::Type to SensorProperty::setVariantType

Companion to libksysguard 0002 (port off the deprecated QVariant::Type),
which changes SensorProperty::setVariantType() to take QMetaType::Type.
The enumerators have the same values (QVariant::Double == QMetaType::Double,
QVariant::Int == QMetaType::Int, QVariant::String == QMetaType::QString,
QVariant::ULongLong == QMetaType::ULongLong), so each sensor reports the same
type id as before. Without this change ksystemstats does not compile against
the patched libksysguard headers. Applies after ksystemstats 0001.

